1862
01:59:22,139 --> 01:59:23,140
Nope.
ບໍ່.

1863
01:59:25,541 --> 01:59:26,613
Okay.
ໂອເຄ

1864
01:59:29,960 --> 01:59:31,209
What are you doin'?
